  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The geometry around boron in the product &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&#39; formed from the following reaction is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>NaH</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mn>450</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>NaF</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NMe</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
