  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>BF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>NaH</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></munder><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>NaF</mi></math></p><p>In this reaction hydride ions replace the fluoride ions. and diborane is formed, which is a Lewis acid due to incomplete octet. It breaks symmetrically with bases like tertiary amines.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Me</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>Me</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></munder><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p>In this product geometry around Boron will be tetrahedral. And it will have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/765f926e-62e1-445e-8179-7f4f70ba8ad8-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 145px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
